    not re-implemented. Full deviation + quality-gate write-up:
    `projects/email-communication-solution-r5/notes/task-034-header-and-attachments-view.md`.
    10/10 new Jest tests green; `tsc --noEmit` clean for all new files (package-wide `npm run
